## 6. NVIDIA and Nebius integration

Second Opinion is designed to use a supported NVIDIA Nemotron model through Nebius Token Factory at runtime.

### Configuration

Create an API key through the official Nebius Token Factory platform.

Configure the following environment variables on the server:

```env
NEBIUS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
NEBIUS_BASE_URL=https://api.tokenfactory.us-central1.nebius.com/v1/
NEBIUS_MODEL=nvidia/Nemotron-3_5-Lightning
```

**Important:** The model ID and endpoint above are proposed defaults based on published Nebius documentation. Confirm the currently available model ID and endpoint against your account before running the application.

The API key must remain on the server and must never be included in client-side JavaScript, committed to Git, or embedded in a public demo.

The actual implementation should make a genuine inference request to Token Factory whenever the user runs an AI analysis.

