## 10. Current scope and limitations

The initial target is a functional web prototype with a complete message-analysis workflow.

### Planned for the initial prototype

*   Text input.
*   Optional URL analysis.
*   AI-assisted message analysis.
*   Rule-based indicators.
*   A structured verdict and explanation.
*   Error handling and a repeatable test set.

### Outside the initial scope (unless implemented separately)

*   WhatsApp or SMS forwarding.
*   Email inbox integration.
*   Live telephone-call analysis.
*   Automatic blocking or reporting.
*   Comprehensive real-time threat intelligence.
*   A production-grade multi-agent orchestration system.
*   Guaranteed scam detection or complete protection against fraud.

The system may misclassify messages, lack current threat intelligence, or fail to identify unfamiliar scam techniques. These limitations must be visible in the final product.

